{
    "title": "Tile Trio: Makeover Match 3d",
    "description": "\ud83e\udde9 Wanna become a tile match 3D guru? Make 3 tiles match to beat our tiles game Tile Trio. Combine tiles\u2013three in a row\u2013to win in these makeover&tile games! \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nIn this mahjong, Join Emma in launching a show about makeovers as a makeover master to change people's lives! In your makeover studio 3D, you\u2019ll dress up contestants and test your interior-decorating skills. \ud83d\udc85 Decide on a beauty care routine to unlock a participant's style and help the girl with her new look in our tile game. Or start a renovation and look for fitting decoration ideas in our freeplay tile game! \ud83c\udfe0\u2b50\r\n\r\nOur tile game combines the complexity of triple match 3D brain-teasers with fun challenges and exciting tile games. \ud83d\udca1 In this makeover&match puzzle, you will merge tiles,three in a row, to earn action points for the makeovers. Match 3D tiles\u2014three in a row\u2014to get rid of every pimple, hunt for awesome home decorations, and enhance your skills as a master of makeup&stylist in this triple tile game! \ud83e\udde0\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\r\n\r\nThis tile game is designed to help you unwind while banishing every pimple to treat acne or scrolling through dresses and hair styles to give everyone a makeover. You can also shift your focus and match 3D tiles to complete your mahjong triple 3D tile match tasks in this superstylist simulator. \ud83e\udde0 It\u2019s not like your average stylist or designer games!\r\n\r\nCollect 3tiles in a line to complete the tiles \u201ctrios\u201d and win these matching games. If you can\u2019t match the blocks correctly, use hints to collect the threes so you won\u2019t mix tiles on the board. \ud83e\udde9 Pass every level of this sorting game to design your room, complete every renovation and build your career as a master of makeup&stylist! Keep your mind active with this puzzle game! \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nThere won\u2019t be just interior designer games: people go to your makeover studio 3D so you can help change their lives! \u2b50 As a superstylist, heal their acne, find a perfect haircut with a hairstyle try on feature, and achieve natural makeup. Design your room in a new style to showcase your interior-decorating skills. Or switch up your makeup games to try seasonal events from this match-3tiles sim! \ud83c\udfae\r\n\r\nEverything is set for your adventures in our triple tile puzzle!\r\n\ud83c\udfae Intuitive mahjong&triple 3d-tile match mechanics: Our brain-teaser will mix tiles\u2014combine and merge tiles (trios) to pass levels of this match tile 3D puzzle.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful projects: In this matching tiles game, get rid of every pimple, use a hairstyle try on feature, help the girl treat her acne, and more!\r\n\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Card collection: Unlock special cards in our puzzle game to get hints for your match tile 3D moves, so you won\u2019t accidentally mix tiles during your makeover&tile matching games. \r\n\ud83d\ude0d Captivating events: Take a break from your makeup games to start a renovation and decorate your home by matching tiles,three in a row!\r\n\ud83e\udd2b Intriguing story: Why have you started a life makeover show and dived into a world of fashion? Find out in our sorting game! \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in house-decorating, advance your career as a makeover master, and enjoy exciting puzzles! Threes are a charm\u2014 it certainly is for our super stylist&fashion makeover&match sim! \u2b50\ud83c\udfae\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll love this freeplay matching tiles game for its awesome super-stylist challenges! Start your journey into the world of tiles-3 puzzles now! Download our super-stylist sim to collect the trios of tiles(3 in a row), and make a career as a super-stylist&fashion makeover master! \ud83c\udfe0\ud83c\udfa8\r\n\r\n\u231b Emma is waiting for you\u2014help her now! Get into our makeover&tile matching game and start your life-changing journey! \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfae",
