ust interior designer games: people go to your makeover studio 3D so you can help change their lives! \u2b50 As a superstylist, heal their acne, find a perfect haircut with a hairstyle try on feature, and achieve natural makeup. Design your room in a new style to showcase your interior-decorating skills. Or switch up your makeup games to try seasonal events from this match-3tiles sim! \ud83c\udfae<br><br>Everything is set for your adventures in our triple tile puzzle!<br>\ud83c\udfae Intuitive mahjong&amp;triple 3d-tile match mechanics: Our brain-teaser will mix tiles\u2014combine and merge tiles (trios) to pass levels of this match tile 3D puzzle.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful projects: In this matching tiles game, get rid of every pimple, use a hairstyle try on feature, help the girl treat her acne, and more!<br>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Card collection: Unlock special cards in our puzzle game to get hints for your match tile 3D moves, so you won\u2019t accidentally mix tiles during your makeover&amp;tile matching games. <br>\ud83d\ude0d Captivating events: Take a break from your makeup games to start a renovation and decorate your home by matching tiles,three in a row!<br>\ud83e\udd2b Intriguing story: Why have you started a life makeover show and dived into a world of fashion? Find out in our sorting game! <br><br>Immerse yourself in house-decorating, advance your career as a makeover master, and enjoy exciting puzzles! Threes are a charm\u2014 it certainly is for our super stylist&amp;fashion makeover&amp;match sim! \u2b50\ud83c\udfae<br><br>You\u2019ll love this freeplay matching tiles game for its awesome super-stylist challenges! Start your journey into the world of tiles-3 puzzles now! Download our super-stylist sim to collect the trios of tiles(3 in a row), and make a career as a super-stylist&amp;fashion makeover master! \ud83c\udfe0\ud83c\udfa8<br><br>\u231b Emma is waiting for you\u2014help her now! Get into our makeover&amp;tile matching game and start your life-changing journey! \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfae",
